        "gg22-ACavrz_text": "Selected",
        "ggoFyq5VrjA_text": "<p>Congratulations.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Out of over 300 applicants, you were selected to be part of our CityLocs Father's Day campaign, and we're excited to have you involved.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This campaign is all about celebrating real dads and turning them into CityLocs hat models through a professional photo shoot that will be featured across our social media, website, and Father's Day marketing campaign.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>We truly appreciate you taking the time to share your story with us, and we can't wait to bring this experience to life.</p>",
