        "checksum": "4126cb41423d191db05fd567f52d9c123160da939e5411a9fb2c9c92c2182ca5_1_1_0_0__1",
        "ggo7qHAXQIQ_text": "<span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#FFFFFF;\"><strong>Important shoot Details</strong></span>",
        "ggiXjkDCxn6_childItem_0": "<p>Shoot Time</p>",
        "ggwE_dknlrq_text": "<p>Please plan to be with us for about <i><strong>1 hour</strong></i>.</p>",
        "gg7HK6TNovc_text": "<p>While your camera time may be shorter, we want to make sure every dad has enough time to feel comfortable, look great, and enjoy the experience.</p>",
        "gglioZg8N1L_text": "<p>During the shoot, we'll also be filming a<i><strong> short interview about being a dad,</strong></i> your story, and what fatherhood means to you. Nothing overly formal –– just real conversations and real moments.</p>",
        "ggXTPQ360gl_childItem_0": "<p>Individual shoot only</p>",
        "gg8Tz9Sl_wY_text": "<p>This is an <i><strong>individual dad-focused shoot</strong></i>, not a family photo session.</p>",
        "ggTFlL5FaDH_text": "<p>To respect everyone's time and keep the schedule running smoothly, we'll be focusing on each selected dad individually throughout the shoot.</p>",
        "ggPRazaPvQI_childItem_0": "<p>compensation</p>",
        "gg95cpsizXG_text": "<p>This is a <i><strong><u>volunteer-based campaign</u></strong></i> and is not a paid modeling shoot.</p>",
        "ggQ9Zd0ZShT_text": "<p>However, selected dads will receive:</p>",
        "gge3yYvP03S_childItem_0": "<p>Professional photos to keep</p>",
        "gge3yYvP03S_childItem_1": "<p>CityLocs merchandise</p>",
        "gge3yYvP03S_childItem_2": "<p>The opportunity to be featured in our Father&#039;s Day Campaign</p>",
        "ggN0D8X-BPH_text": "<span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#151515;\"><strong>What to wear</strong></span>",
        "ggvbt5rk5YL_background_desktop_image_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0519/6401/files/style-guide-1cb.png",
        "gg9bXdJO5RS_text": "Recommended",
        "ggZs3VGLpSP_childItem_0": "<p>Polos</p>",
        "ggZs3VGLpSP_childItem_1": "<p>Button-ups</p>",
        "ggZs3VGLpSP_childItem_2": "<p>Button-downs</p>",
        "ggZs3VGLpSP_childItem_3": "<p>Clean workwear-inspired outfits</p>",
        "ggZs3VGLpSP_childItem_4": "<p>Neutral or solid colors</p>",
        "ggirndCvqO7_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0519/6401/files/sched-img-1bx2.png",
        "ggirndCvqO7_srcSet_mobile_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0519/6401/files/style-guide-1b.png",
        "gg9i8BOry9y_background_desktop_image_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0519/6401/files/sched-img-2x2.png",
        "ggrWQW9WYd__text": "Please avoid",
        "ggLSEwMLtv5_childItem_0": "<p>Large logos</p>",
        "ggLSEwMLtv5_childItem_1": "<p>Sports team apparel</p>",
        "ggLSEwMLtv5_childItem_2": "<p>Busy graphics or distracting designs</p>",
        "ggGGcE8lXTl_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0519/6401/files/sched-img-2bx2.png",
        "ggcR3jSdUGO_text": "<p>The focus of this campaign is YOU and the CityLos hats, so clean and timeless outfits work best.</p>",
        "ggn06_QwVs2_text": "<p>A fresh haircut or beard trim is highly recommended if possible.</p>"
      }
    },
